<<<
Most of the nouns in -sation, -tation, come from Latin frequentatives in -so, -to, as conversation (L verto turn, versor move about), hesitation (L haereo stick, haesito keep sticking).
===
Most of the nouns in *-sation, -tation*, come from Latin frequentatives in *-so, -to*, as *conversation* (L *verto* turn, *versor* move about), *hesitation* (L *haereo* stick, *haesito* keep sticking).
>>>

